### Clean Update Loop

Inside your main `visual(dt)` or `frame()`:

```ts
// Effects
this.effects.update(dt);

// NPCs
this.ninja?.update();

// Optional: pause distant videos for performance
const distToNinja = this.camera.position.distanceTo(this.ninja.position);
if (distToNinja > 40) {
  this.ninja.pause();
} else {
  this.ninja.play();
}
```

